=== 2026-09-07 ap1 hidden from NM applet ===
USER REPORT: ap1 listed in NM as dead wifi entry; confusing.
FACT: ap1 is hostapd's interface (the local fake AP the STA associates
to) — required, cannot not-create. Fix is visibility, not existence:
new pc/systemd/nm-a32wifishim.conf ([device] match mon1+ap1, managed=0)
installed to /etc/NetworkManager/conf.d/ by install.sh (+ nmcli general
reload, non-disruptive); orchestrator also calls nmcli device set ap1
managed no per bringup for manual (non-installer) runs. ap1 keep-alive
behavior unchanged (fast reuse across sessions).
